    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay good to know. i was a bit worried but it's a relief if it's just part of being pregnant. i've also had a bit of a headache for a few hours, nothing crazy, just a dull ache. maybe i just need to drink more water and sleep more? do you think i should be doing anything else at home to help with the swelling?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
