      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A dull headache is a common side effect of pregnancy and can often be managed with hydration and rest. Drinking plenty of water and elevating your legs can help reduce swelling in your hands and feet. You can also try taking a warm bath or applying a cold compress to the affected areas to reduce swelling.",
      "source": "target",
